  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil and sauté the onion and garlic in a 6-quart pot for 2 minutes.",
    "Add the stew meat, water, salt, pepper, barley, lima beans, split peas, bay leaf, and marrow bones. Bring to a boil.",
    "Lower the flame and simmer, covered, for 1 hour.",
    "Add the potato, carrots, celery, string beans, tomato puree, and parsley. Cook for an additional 1½ hours.",
    "Serve hot."
